# Public client configuration. Copy this file to .env for local development.
# VITE_ values are compiled into the browser bundle; never add a secret.
#
# m2-08 (docs/planning/issues/m2-08-feat-lifeos-shell-integration.md): these
# settings re-point to the platform project, per
# backend/docs/runbook.md's "Auth re-point to the platform IdP (m2-08)"
# section -- VITE_SUPABASE_URL / VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY move from the
# lifeos-prod project to the SAME platform (toolbelt) Supabase project every
# other hyperbolic-core zone reads its session from (ADR-03); leaving them
# unset falls back to that platform project's already-public defaults
# (src/lib/session.ts), matching apps/shell/src/lib/session.ts's identical
# fallback. VITE_API_URL is now optional: unset, it defaults to "/life/api"
# (the one-origin route table's own prefix, src/api/client.ts) rather than
# needing a full origin -- set it only for local dev against a backend that
# is not reachable at that same-origin relative path.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_API_URL=
